import pathlib,re,hashlib
exec(pathlib.Path(__file__).with_name('common.py').read_text(encoding='utf-8-sig'))
reviews=load('docs/editorial/news-reviews.json');news=[]
def article(k,slug,z,e,d,de,pairs,sources,rv):
 paras=[('背景與發展','Background and developments',*pairs[0])]+[('','',*p) for p in pairs[1:]]
 paras.append(('資料與報導方法','Sources and reporting method',rv.pop('method'),rv.pop('methodEn')))
 a=write(k,slug,z,e,d,de,paras,sources,extra=dict(tags=[k,'education','2026'],topic={'eu':'europe','uk':'uk','au':'australia'}[k]))
 raw=re.split(r'^---\s*$',(R/a['publishedPath']).read_text(encoding='utf8'),flags=re.M)[2]
 rv.update(bodySha256=hashlib.sha256(raw.encode()).hexdigest(),reviewedAt=NOW,primarySource=sources[0][1],independentSource=sources[1][1]);reviews[slug]=rv;news.append(a)
article('eu','eu-india-horizon-europe-negotiations-concluded-2027','印度加入歐盟科研合作再進一步：談判完成，2027上路仍待程序','India moves closer to Horizon Europe: negotiations conclude, with procedures still ahead','歐盟與印度完成Horizon Europe第二支柱參與談判；台灣研究生可追蹤合作團隊，但不能把協議當成個人獎學金。','The EU and India have concluded talks on association to Horizon Europe Pillar II. Researchers can watch emerging partnerships, but this is not an individual scholarship.',[
('歐盟與印度11月6日宣布完成印度參與Horizon Europe的談判，目標是在2027年1月起建立更密切的科研合作。這項進展對準備研究型學位、正在尋找跨國實驗室的台灣學生值得留意：未來合作網絡可能擴大，但談判完成與協議正式生效仍是兩件事。目前不能據此宣稱印度已取得所有計畫權利，也不能把參與資格當成個人的錄取或資助承諾。','The EU and India announced on November 6 that negotiations on Indian association to Horizon Europe had concluded, targeting a closer research relationship from January 2027. Taiwanese students considering research degrees can watch how collaboration networks develop. Concluding talks is distinct from bringing an agreement into force: India cannot yet be described as having every programme right, and association does not promise admission or funding to an individual.'),
('官方EURAXESS說明，談判涵蓋的是第二支柱，以共同研究處理全球挑戰與產業競爭力。健康、數位、工業與太空，以及氣候、能源和生物經濟等領域都在其合作框架內。Horizon Europe整體2021至2027年的預算約935億歐元，這是整個多年計畫的規模，並非新劃給印度的專款，更不是一次提供給國際學生的獎學金總額。','The official EURAXESS announcement identifies Pillar II, which supports collaborative research on global challenges and industrial competitiveness. Its areas include health, digital technologies, industry, space, climate, energy and the bioeconomy. Horizon Europe’s approximately €93.5 billion budget covers the entire 2021–2027 programme; it is neither a new allocation to India nor a scholarship fund reserved for international students.'),
('The Times Higher Education的11月6日報導同樣將範圍限定於第二支柱，而不是整套Horizon Europe。這個區分會影響研究者查詢機會的方式：某國取得部分計畫的關聯國地位，不代表每一種個人研究補助、訓練方案或徵件都同步開放。學生應記下具體徵件名稱和適用規則，再確認所在機構能以何種身分加入，不能只憑「加入歐盟科研計畫」這個大標題下判斷。','Times Higher Education’s November 6 report also limits the scope to Pillar II, rather than all of Horizon Europe. Association to one part of a programme does not automatically open every individual grant, training scheme or call. Applicants need the actual call and its eligibility rules, followed by confirmation of their institution’s role, rather than relying on a headline about joining European research.'),
('這並非雙方第一次合作。官方回顧，歐盟與印度已有自2001年起的科技合作協定，並已延長至2030年；本次參與談判則經過2026年2月的探索接觸與7月正式啟動。這條時間線說明，11月的新消息是談判走到完成階段，而不是兩地科研交流從零開始。既有合作與新的制度安排可以並存，報導時不宜把先前研究成果全部算成新協議的效果。','Cooperation predates these negotiations. The official account traces the science and technology agreement to 2001, with renewal through 2030, and describes exploratory contacts in February 2026 followed by formal negotiations in July. November’s development is completion of the talks, not the invention of EU–India scientific exchange. Existing work and a new institutional framework can coexist; earlier results should not be credited to an agreement that has not yet taken effect.'),
('布魯塞爾政策媒體2EU的分析補充，印度機構原本就能參與不少合作徵件，只是經費可能來自自身、印度共同資助，或符合例外的歐盟支持。關聯國安排的重要改變在於直接取得歐盟資助及帶領符合條件的合作計畫的制度基礎。換言之，新聞重點不是「從完全不能參加變成全部可參加」，而是經費資格、協調角色與合作條件可能更接近會員國機構。','Brussels policy outlet 2EU explains that Indian organisations can already enter many collaborative calls, using their own resources, Indian co-funding or exceptional EU support. Association changes the basis for direct EU funding and coordination of eligible projects. The development is therefore about funding eligibility and leadership roles, rather than a switch from complete exclusion to unrestricted access.'),
('仍有幾個問題沒有定案。依官方公告與2EU對程序的說明，協議須完成後續簽署及相關批准；當次公告也沒有交代印度最終財務貢獻的完整數額。即使生效，計畫仍要依徵件目標、競爭評選與特定領域限制辦理。可參加不等於得標，合作團隊增加也不等於每個學門都會立即出現新的博士名額，這些都需要後續實際徵件與聘任資訊支持。','Outstanding steps include signature and the relevant approval procedures. The announcement does not give a complete figure for India’s financial contribution. After entry into force, call objectives, competitive assessment and any field-specific restrictions will still apply. Eligibility is not an award, and additional collaboration does not by itself establish new doctoral vacancies in every discipline; actual calls and recruitment notices will be needed.'),
('對台灣學生而言，最實用的切入點是研究題目和團隊，而不是先依國籍新聞決定去向。本刊的編輯建議是，查閱潛在指導教授正在參與的計畫，確認自己的研究工作是否屬於合作內容，再問清楚招生由哪所學校辦理、學位由誰授予。跨國團隊的經費可以用於多種活動，不能從一筆大型計畫總額直接推算學生能領多少生活費或學費減免。','For Taiwanese students, the practical starting point is the research question and team. Our editorial advice is to examine a prospective supervisor’s projects, ask how the proposed work fits, and establish which institution handles admission and awards the degree. A collaborative budget supports many activities; its headline value cannot establish a student’s stipend or tuition reduction.'),
('準備申請時，也可把學位申請、研究職缺與短期交流分成三欄整理。它們可能由不同單位負責，有不同期限與甄選條件，某項研究合作成立不會自動完成另外兩項程序。若學校宣傳新的歐印合作，應要求可供查驗的課程或職缺頁，而非只看合作備忘錄和活動照片；這能讓家庭比較真正可申請的機會，也避免把研究合作消息誤當升學保證。','Keep degree applications, research vacancies and short exchanges in separate columns. Different offices, deadlines and selection rules may apply, and a research partnership does not complete the other procedures. When an institution promotes EU–India cooperation, ask for the relevant course or vacancy page rather than relying on memoranda and event photographs. This turns a broad development into opportunities that can actually be assessed.'),
('接下來值得追蹤的是協議生效日期、正式涵蓋範圍、徵件文件是否更新，以及哪些機構公布實際合作職位。本文能確認的是談判已完成、方向指向第二支柱及2027年初的目標；尚不能確認每名申請人的經費或合作案結果。對研究生最有價值的閱讀方式，是把這則新聞當成追蹤新團隊的起點，最後仍回到可核對的入學與資助文件。','The next evidence will be an effective date, final scope, updated calls and institutional vacancies. The confirmed development is completion of talks aimed at Pillar II association from early 2027. Individual funding and project outcomes remain unknown. For prospective researchers, the news is a starting point for tracking teams, with decisions grounded in the eventual admission and funding documents.')],
[('EURAXESS — EU–India negotiations concluded','https://euraxess.ec.europa.eu/worldwide/india/news/eu-india-eu-and-india-conclude-negotiations-association-horizon-europe'),('Times Higher Education — November 6 report','https://www.timeshighereducation.com/news/india-set-join-horizon-europe-january-2027'),('2EU — funding and procedure analysis','https://2eu.brussels/en/news/eu-and-india-conclude-talks-to-give-indian-organisations-direct-access-to-horizon-europe-funding')],
dict(newsValue='11月6日新完成歐盟印度科研參與談判，關聯跨國研究網絡與台灣研究型升學選擇。',background='交代2001科技合作、2026探索與正式談判，避免把既有研究合作全部說成新協議成果。',development='確認第二支柱範圍與2027目標，明示談判完成未等於正式生效，935億為全計畫規模。',perspectives='官方呈現合作方向，THE確認有限範圍，2EU提供既有參與、經費資格與法律程序的分析。',taiwanImpact='將研究題目、指導團隊、入學單位、學位授予與個人資助分開查詢，避免合作消息成升學保證。',uncertainty='簽署批准及財務貢獻未完整確立，不推算新職缺與台灣個人得獎機率，等待實際徵件。',independence='EURAXESS為公告來源，THE另有署名報導；2EU獨立拆解既有參與及法制程序，非三篇轉載。',method='實讀官方公告、THE可公開閱讀的正文與2EU程序分析。沒有新增採訪；布魯塞爾歐盟執委會照片為授權資料照，非本次談判現場。',methodEn='We read the official announcement, publicly accessible THE reporting and 2EU’s procedural analysis. No new interviews were conducted. The licensed photograph depicts the Commission building in Brussels, not the negotiations.'))
article('uk','uk-industrial-strategy-higher-education-finance-review-2026','英國產業顧問要求檢討大學財務：人才戰略能否落實，先看教學能力','UK industrial advisers call for a university finance review: skills plans depend on teaching capacity','11月年度報告要求加快處理高教與技職財務，建議十年技能計畫；這是顧問建議，並非已核定的新經費。','A November annual report urges action on university and college finances and a ten-year skills plan. These are advisory recommendations, not newly approved funding.',[
('英國產業策略諮詢委員會11月5日發布年度報告，把高等教育與技職教育的財務可持續性列為產業策略的實質風險，要求政府急迫處理，並提出獨立檢討的方向。對考慮赴英的台灣家庭，值得關注的不是把全國財務壓力直接解讀成某校危機，而是人才政策需要足夠教師、訓練場所與穩定課程才能落實；學校能提供哪些資源，應成為選校問題的一部分。','The UK Industrial Strategy Advisory Council’s annual report, published on November 5, identifies the financial sustainability of higher and further education as a material risk to industrial strategy. It urges action, potentially through an independent review. Taiwanese families should not translate a sector-level concern into a prediction about a particular institution. The relevant issue is whether teachers, facilities and stable courses can support the skills ambitions.'),
('這個委員會負責向政府提供產業策略建議。Wonkhe在11月6日的分析指出，它由微軟英國主管Clare Barclay擔任主席，前曼徹斯特大學校長Nancy Rothwell擔任副主席，當時仍屬非法律設立的顧問安排。成員的產業與大學背景讓財務問題獲得跨部門重視，但報告沒有代替國會預算、政府撥款或大學自己的校務決策，建議和已執行政策必須區分。','Wonkhe’s November 6 analysis describes the council as a non-statutory advisory body chaired by Microsoft UK’s Clare Barclay, with former Manchester vice-chancellor Nancy Rothwell as deputy. The mix of industrial and university experience brings cross-sector attention to education finance. It does not turn the report into a budget appropriation, a government funding decision or an institutional operating plan.'),
('報告主張產業策略的方向仍然正確，但執行速度要加快。技能需求不只由應屆畢業生補足，現有勞動者也需要培訓；雇主、員工與教育機構之間的協調因此是核心。本文將這項主張理解為對供給能力的提醒：如果一面要求學校培養更多高技能人才，一面忽略教師招募、設備與長期經費，課程名稱再符合熱門產業，也不代表教學供給已準備好。','The report maintains that the strategy’s direction is right while calling for faster delivery. Skills needs extend beyond new graduates to the existing workforce, making coordination among employers, workers and providers essential. Our interpretation is that this is a warning about capacity: an attractive industry-facing course title cannot establish that staffing, equipment and long-term support are ready for expanded demand.'),
('官方年報列出，英格蘭36%的高等教育提供者在2024/25年度呈現赤字。這是報告使用的機構比例及會計年度，不是36%的學生將受停課影響，也不是每所英國大學都有相同財務狀況。部分媒體正文對年度出現不一致寫法，本刊回到年報原文核對為2024/25；理解這個數字前，須同時保留地區、機構範圍與年度，避免以全英國或未來數年取代它。','The official report says 36% of English higher education providers were in deficit in 2024/25. This is a provider proportion for a stated accounting year, not a prediction that 36% of students will lose classes or that every UK university faces the same position. We checked the year against the report because secondary coverage contained an inconsistent date. Geography, institutional scope and year all matter.'),
('技職教育面臨另一組供需問題：報告引用預測，2025至2028年間16至18歲人口將增加約7萬人，並討論學院可能需要更多教師。年報對師資需求使用估計區間，不能把上限當成已核定的招聘名額。委員會因此建議用十年時間尺度規劃技能體系的容量、能力與經費，而不是只靠單一學年應急；這也說明大學與學院在同一人才政策裡，卻有不同的服務對象。','For further education, the report cites a projected increase of around 70,000 people aged 16–18 between 2025 and 2028 and discusses additional teacher requirements. Estimates of staffing need are not authorised recruitment positions. The proposed ten-year view covers capacity, capability and funding, rather than a single year of emergency action. Universities and colleges sit within the same skills agenda but serve different needs.'),
('Wonkhe的評論將這份年報放在政府八大成長產業的脈絡中，認為高教財務警訊值得政策制定者正視。THE的報導也聚焦於顧問要求更積極處理大學財務。兩者都不能證明政府已接受所有建議；目前可核對的是委員會提出的問題與方案，而非新的學費制度、特定大學救助或國際學生資助。這條界線尤其重要，因為家庭很容易把「政府將檢討」讀成費用即將下降。','Wonkhe places the warning in the context of the government’s eight growth sectors, while THE focuses on the call for stronger action over university finances. Neither establishes adoption of every recommendation. The evidence concerns a diagnosis and proposed response, not a new fee system, an institutional rescue or international student aid. A review proposal should not be read as a promise that a family’s costs will fall.'),
('對正在選校的人，本刊建議把宏觀新聞轉成課程層級的查詢。實驗室課程可問必修實驗在哪個校區完成、專業設備使用是否已列入教學；實習導向課程則可查支持團隊、合作方式及沒有取得職位時的安排。這些不是因為本文認定某校資源不足，而是幫助學生確認宣傳與實際學習條件能否相符，讓財務新聞成為提出具體問題的依據。','Our editorial advice is to turn the broad concern into course-level questions. Laboratory students can ask where compulsory practical work takes place and how equipment access is built into teaching. Placement students can examine support teams, employer arrangements and alternatives when no position is secured. These questions do not imply that a particular institution lacks resources; they test how promotion matches provision.'),
('學生也應分清學校整體收支、某個系所的資源安排與自己的付款義務。三者相關，卻不能直接相互推導。即使學校公布成本調整，仍須讀自己那一屆課程的正式通知；即使產業政策看好某領域，也不保證該科系畢業者就業。先保留學費、課程地點、必修內容與學生支持的書面資訊，比依一則全國性標題推測哪所學校「安全」更能支援實際選擇。','Institution-wide finances, a department’s resources and a student’s payment obligations are related but not interchangeable. Cost changes need to be checked against notices for the particular cohort. Industrial policy support for a field does not guarantee graduate employment. Written information on fees, location, compulsory teaching and support is more useful than using a national headline to label institutions as safe or unsafe.'),
('後續觀察重點是政府是否啟動檢討、是否提出可追蹤的十年計畫，以及經費和培訓參與資料能否顯示改善。年報提出監測技能投資、培訓參與和缺工等指標，這比單純計算公布了多少政策更接近執行成果。目前仍沒有足夠資料把這份報告與個別台灣學生的費用或就業結果連結；新聞提供的是需要追問的制度問題，而不是個人升學風險評分。','Watch for a government review, a trackable ten-year plan and evidence on funding and training participation. The council’s proposed monitoring of investment, participation and shortages directs attention to implementation rather than announcement counts. The report does not establish effects on an individual Taiwanese student’s costs or employment. It identifies institutional questions, not a personal risk score.')],
[('ISAC — official annual report 2026','https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6aeb270b88d44387aeae0693/industrial-strategy-advisory-council-annual-report-2026.pdf'),('Wonkhe — independent policy analysis, November 6','https://wonkhe.com/wonk-corner/industrial-strategy-advisory-council-rings-the-alarm-about-he-funding/'),('THE — advisers and higher education finances','https://www.timeshighereducation.com/news/industrial-strategy-advisers-urge-radical-action-he-finances'),('GOV.UK — publication and purpose','https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/industrial-strategy-advisory-council-annual-report-2026')],
dict(newsValue='11月5日新年度報告及11月6日教育媒體分析，將大學財務與人才培育供給連接，具選校意義。',background='交代顧問委員會定位及八大產業、現職勞動者訓練需求，不把報告當政府預算決議。',development='PDF頁11、22、46確認財務風險、十年技能計畫與36%赤字正確年度2024/25，修正媒體疑誤。',perspectives='將產業與大學背景顧問、Wonkhe政策評論及THE報導分開陳述，不假造政府已採納的回應。',taiwanImpact='協助台灣家庭把財務新聞轉成實驗室、校區、課程及實習支持查詢，不對個校作無據風險評級。',uncertainty='缺政府採納與撥款結果，不宣稱新增補助、降學費或畢業工作保證，後續追蹤實際執行資料。',independence='年報為官方原始資料，Wonkhe署名分析提出機構定位與產業政策解讀，THE另提供教育新聞報導。',method='下載並擷取官方78頁PDF，實讀相關頁面及Wonkhe、THE正文。未進行校園財務審計；伯明罕大學照片僅為英國校園資料照，不代表該校有文中赤字。',methodEn='We downloaded the 78-page official PDF, read relevant sections and checked Wonkhe and THE coverage. No institutional audit was conducted. The Birmingham campus photograph does not imply that the university has the deficit described in the sector statistic.'))
article('au','australian-university-governance-transition-november-2026','澳洲大學領導組織整合上路：學生代表與治理透明度成下一步','Australian university leadership consolidation takes effect: representation and transparency next','Swinburne確認校董首長組織已結束運作，並規劃2027年師生代表選舉；全國組織整合與個校治理改革須分開看。','Swinburne confirms the chancellors’ body has closed and outlines a 2027 staff and student election. National representation and institutional governance are distinct changes.',[
('澳洲大學的領導代表架構正在轉變。Swinburne科技大學11月6日說明，University Chancellors Council已於10月31日結束運作，校董首長與大學校長將在Universities Australia架構下共同參與全國代表工作。對準備赴澳的學生而言，這不是大學合併或學位更名，而是誰在全國政策討論中代表大學，以及如何把治理責任和學生聲音放進制度。','Australia’s national university representation is changing. Swinburne’s November 6 update confirms that the University Chancellors Council ceased operating on October 31, bringing chancellors and vice-chancellors together within Universities Australia. This is not a merger of universities or a change to degrees. It concerns national representation, governance responsibility and the place of student voices.'),
('整合方案早在9月28日已由Universities Australia公布，並非11月才突然決定。當時說明以三名校董首長加入過渡架構，後續完整董事會安排預計在2027年3月年度大會確認。本文以11月校方公告追蹤已到來的轉換節點，同時保留原始決議時間，避免把同一項改革每隔幾週重新當成全新政策，也避免把尚待年度大會的程序寫成已完成。','Universities Australia announced the arrangement on September 28. It described an interim role for three chancellors, with the full board arrangement to be ratified at the March 2027 annual meeting. This article follows the transition through a November institutional update while retaining the original decision date. Procedures awaiting the annual meeting should not be represented as completed.'),
('這兩種領導角色本來就不相同：校董會負責治理及監督，校長與行政團隊負責日常經營。全國代表組織將兩者納入同一架構，並設置由校董首長領導的治理工作安排，意圖讓政策代表與治理議題更緊密連結。然而組織圖改變不會自行證明治理品質提升，仍需觀察資訊公開、會議運作與責任分工是否在個別學校落實，而非只看成員名單。','Governing councils oversee institutions, while vice-chancellors and executive teams manage operations. Bringing their representatives into one national body, with a chancellor-led governance committee, aims to connect representation with governance work. An organisational change does not by itself prove better governance. Disclosure, meeting practice and accountability must still be examined at institutional level.'),
('教育部長Jason Clare在10月7日向校董首長會議的公開致詞，提供了校方以外的政策背景。他強調大學仍應保有課程、研究與人事上的自主，同時指出公共資源支持帶來對透明度與公共利益的責任。這是一份政府的正式政策立場，不是獨立審計結果；它可以用來核對改革期待，卻不能證明每所學校都已達到那些要求。','Education minister Jason Clare’s October 7 public address supplies a government perspective beyond the institutional announcement. He emphasised university autonomy over courses, research and appointments alongside accountability for public support. The speech establishes the government’s policy position, not an independent audit finding or proof of compliance at every university.'),
('部長列出的另一條改革線，是2027年1月1日起適用的高等教育門檻標準變更，涵蓋校董會會議結果、顧問支出、主管外部職務及薪酬等資訊公開。這與Universities Australia自身組織整合並不是同一件事：前者關係全國監理標準，後者是大學代表團體的安排。把兩條線分開，才能知道學生查詢某項資料時應找校方、代表團體還是監管機關。','A separate reform concerns changes to the Higher Education Standards Framework taking effect on January 1, 2027, including disclosure of council outcomes, consultancy spending, executives’ outside roles and remuneration. These regulatory standards are distinct from Universities Australia’s restructuring. Separating the two helps identify whether a question belongs with the institution, the representative body or the regulator.'),
('Swinburne的11月公告也提出校內措施，包括增加民選教職員與學生的校董會席次，並將選舉安排在2027年3月。校方另提及原住民族諮詢機制與外部年度勞動力報告等方向。這些是該校披露的進度和計畫，不可推廣成澳洲所有大學已有相同席次或同一天選舉；是否完成、代表如何產生及能參與哪些決策，仍需要下一階段正式文件。','Swinburne separately outlines additional elected staff and student council positions, with an election planned for March 2027, as well as a First Nations advisory mechanism and external annual workforce reporting. These are the institution’s stated plans and progress. They do not establish identical seats or election dates across Australia. Formal implementation documents will be needed to confirm selection and decision-making roles.'),
('對台灣學生，治理議題最直接的問題是能否找到清楚的學生代表與申訴管道。本刊建議在選校資料中加入代表選舉、學術申訴及服務意見反映的官方入口，並確認國際生在適用程序中的身分。這不是要求學生自行判讀所有董事會文件，而是讓遇到課程變更、支持不足或校務爭議時，知道哪些事情能由學生代表提出、哪些必須走正式個案程序。','For Taiwanese students, useful questions concern student representation and clear complaint routes. Our editorial recommendation is to record official election, academic appeal and service-feedback pages and check how international students participate. The aim is not to require students to interpret every council paper. It is to distinguish collective representation from formal individual procedures when courses, services or disputes arise.'),
('透明度也有助於看懂學校如何說明決策，但公開一份報告不等於所有問題已解決。比較大學時，可看資訊是否容易找到、是否註明適用日期，以及重大變更是否向受影響學生說明。不同學校的法定架構和委員會名稱可能不同，因此不宜只比較席次數量便宣布誰最好；更重要的是代表是否有明確職責，以及學生能否理解與使用相關管道。','Disclosure can clarify decisions, but publishing a report does not settle every concern. Applicants can examine whether information is accessible, dated and communicated to affected cohorts. Institutions differ in their legal structures and committee names, so seat counts alone cannot rank governance quality. Clear responsibilities and usable routes for students are more meaningful than a simple numerical comparison.'),
('下一階段的驗證點包括2027年門檻標準正式適用、各校公開內容，以及Universities Australia年度大會與Swinburne選舉的後續。部長另提及預計提出監管立法，本文沒有將這項意向說成法律已完成。現階段可確認組織轉換已發生，並有校方提出具體時間表；尚不能據此推斷教學品質、學費或畢業就業已改善，這些仍需各自的結果證據。','The next checkpoints are the new standards, institutional disclosures, Universities Australia’s annual meeting and Swinburne’s election. The minister also referred to intended regulatory legislation; this article does not present that intention as enacted law. The organisational transition and stated timetable are verifiable. Effects on teaching, fees or graduate employment require separate evidence.')],
[('Swinburne — November 6 implementation update','https://www.swinburne.edu.au/news/2026/11/landmark-reform-of-australian-university-leadership/'),('Education Minister — October 7 original policy address','https://ministers.education.gov.au/clare/address-university-chancellors-council-plenary-meeting'),('Universities Australia — September 28 original decision','https://universitiesaustralia.edu.au/media-item/university-leadership-comes-together-to-strengthen-national-voice/')],
dict(newsValue='11月6日Swinburne更新10月31日組織終止後的轉換與明年師生選舉，追蹤學生參與治理。',background='保留9月28原決定和10月7部長說明，分清校董治理、行政管理、代表團體與監理標準。',development='原文確認UCC結束日期、2027年3月年度大會與校方選舉計畫，未把待辦程序當已落實。',perspectives='校方與大學團體說明整合設計，教育部長原始致詞呈現自主及公共責任期待，明示非審計。',taiwanImpact='引導台灣學生查代表、申訴與服務回應入口，區分集體參與及個案程序，不承諾個人權利結果。',uncertainty='未獲各校合規實證或改革結果，不推斷教學、費用及就業改善，擬議立法未當已通過。',independence='校方及UA為改革當事方；政府部長原始公開致詞為不同機構政策來源，非校方稿件轉載，並揭露其立場。',method='實讀Swinburne、UA與教育部長公開原文，交叉核對時程及制度範圍。本文為治理政策追蹤，未訪問學生或進行合規審計；校園照片非改革會議現場。',methodEn='We read the original Swinburne, Universities Australia and ministerial statements and compared dates and scope. This is governance policy follow-up without student interviews or a compliance audit. The campus photograph does not depict a reform meeting.'))
